# Airoha AN7581/EN7581 (XR1710G) - OpenWrt SNAPSHOT software repositories
#
# Architecture: aarch64_cortex-a53 (APK index format: packages.adb)
#
# The official SNAPSHOT feeds below match the kernel baseline (6.18 / master)
# of this firmware image. The same feeds are also generated automatically into
# /etc/apk/repositories.d/distfeeds.list at build time - entries listed here
# are kept so the repositories stay available even if distfeeds.list is reset.
#
# NOTE: kernel module (kmods) packages are version locked and are served from
# the distfeeds.list entry only - do not manually pin kmods URLs here.

# Official OpenWrt SNAPSHOT feeds
https://downloads.openwrt.org/snapshots/packages/aarch64_cortex-a53/base/packages.adb
https://downloads.openwrt.org/snapshots/packages/aarch64_cortex-a53/luci/packages.adb
https://downloads.openwrt.org/snapshots/packages/aarch64_cortex-a53/packages/packages.adb
https://downloads.openwrt.org/snapshots/packages/aarch64_cortex-a53/routing/packages.adb
https://downloads.openwrt.org/snapshots/packages/aarch64_cortex-a53/telephony/packages.adb
https://downloads.openwrt.org/snapshots/packages/aarch64_cortex-a53/video/packages.adb

# Third-party repositories (optional, uncomment to enable).
# Only use repositories built against the same SNAPSHOT baseline to avoid
# libc / library version mismatches with this image.
#
# https://downloads.immortalwrt.org/snapshots/packages/aarch64_cortex-a53/base/packages.adb
# https://downloads.immortalwrt.org/snapshots/packages/aarch64_cortex-a53/luci/packages.adb
# https://downloads.immortalwrt.org/snapshots/packages/aarch64_cortex-a53/packages/packages.adb